PROBLEM STATEMENT
----------------
A customer support company receives thousands of queries daily. To prioritize
customer requests, the company wants an AI system that identifies the urgency level of
each query.
Your task is to design an effective prompt that analyzes a customer query and classifies
its urgency.

Input: A customer query in natural language.
Output: A single word representing the urgency level.
Allowed Outputs:
• High
• Medium
• Low


PROMPT
------------
You are an expert sentiment analyzer that analyzes the urgency level of customer queries recieved by a customer support company.
The input is in the form of queries expressed by customers in natural lannguage. The output must be one of the allowed outputs that represents the urgency level of the customer query, do not add any explanation or additional text or punctuation to the output. The output is a single word from one of the allowed outputs.

Allowed Outputs:
• High - Queries that require immediate attention, it represnts the highest level of urgent attention, it includes queries related to loss of money, loss of access to acccount, takeover by malware or other cybersecurity threats,
anything critical that threatens the customer work or routine, failure of company systems or infrastructure.
• Medium - Queries that require medium level attention, these queries are NOT critical or deeply serious, lie between high and low labels, includes defect or complaints in the companys products that are minor.
• Low - Queries that require lowest level of attention, these queries do not affect the customers work or life in any major way, they do not require immediate attention, there is no sense of urgency, the matter is not pressing.
